      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "QUEEN FLOW (8) has been hard to follow lately, running sixth (20.02) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Angle Park. Can turn form around here. HASTY HOLLY (1) has a strong record here with three wins and two placings from nine starts. Recorded a 3.5 lengths win (43.26) in a Grade 6 last time at Angle Park. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. BRINDLE WARRIOR (2) recorded a Grade 6 win two back then missed the frame last time at this track, but drawn Box 2 this time where he has won before. Rates a winning chance on best. KILCOY LASS (7) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (19.86) over 342m at Angle Park.",
